      "side": 1,
      "message": "so, this was a change i wanted to add to the oauth spec; i want to put consumer_id back into the oauth section of the token.\n\nreason: when we delete an access token, i grab the consumer id and call delete_tokens with that consumer id (to revoke any issued tokens). In delete_tokens, I can just compare consumer_ids and delete any issued tokens. Otherwise I\u0027d have to call the oauth_api.get_access_token using the access_token  to get the consumer_id. That seems round-about, and having the consumer_id in there seems simpler.",
